<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,014 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,014 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 1,014 contracts compared with 633 overnight Tuesday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 63 wheat, 429 corn, 389 soybean, 43 soymeal, and 90 soyoil contracts traded..</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was one to 2-3/4 cent higher, corn was 1/4 cent lower and soybeans were 2-3/4 to 2-1/4 cents higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
